[PrintTextModified Text:那就是城崎诺亚。|#0101Adv36_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——有人在蕾雅的耳边悄声说道。|#0101Adv36_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Visible:false Rotation:,,0 Scale:1 TintColor:#000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Rotation:,,-5 Scale:1.9 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false ScenePosition:40,42 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1 SubId:Middle
