@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Noah-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:60 EasingTypeName:Linear Duration:10
@Wait WaitMode:0.8

[PrintTextModified Text:不除掉引人注目的她，你就没法成为全场焦点哦？<br>真可怜啊。|#0101Adv36_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在那时，蕾雅决定要杀死城崎诺亚。|#0101Adv36_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样一来，大家都只会注视我了。<br>可是到头来，果然。|#0101Adv36_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

