[PrintTextModified Text:在下次审判到来之前，请大家跟往常一样，<br>老实规矩地作为囚犯生活下去吧。|#0101Adv36_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女审判，就此闭庭。<br>哎呀呀，真是辛苦大家了……|#0101Adv36_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

